@rashaun_williams discusses how Shark Tank has changed his life and speaks about his relationship with @mcuban. "I never really wanted to be a billionaire my entire life ... until I met Mark Cuban and Arthur Blank."

He recounts how Mark Cuban became his partner in Harbinger Sports Partners after Williams shared his idea on acquiring minority stakes in franchises that he believes offer significant upside and create liquidity opportunities.

